[[576,127,262144,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the compressor\nengagement circuit.</p><p>The relay receives a supply from the line\ncontrolled by the ignition (INT/A) for the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected\nby fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are housed in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The coil is supplied by the line from fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98 A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , of the main injection relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nthe relay is energized by an earth signal coming from the engine\nmanagement control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : in this way the air conditioning compressor\nengagement electro-magnet \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>L20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is operated through a voltage\nof 12 V.</p><p>Climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70 ( pin 11 of\nconnector A) sends a compressor enablement signal to four-stage\npressure switch K10. If circuit pressures are correct, the signal\nleaves the pressure switch and reaches engine control unit M10 -\npin 60 of connector A.</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               According to its internal control logic,\nthe control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends - from pin 18 of connector A -\nthe command to engage the compressor which energizes the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]